a little more room for growth.

1390
01:22:53.309 --> 01:22:55.510
Jade Palace?

1391
01:22:56.979 --> 01:22:58.181
Her?

1392
01:22:58.214 --> 01:22:59.982
Out of all the candidates

1393
01:23:00.016 --> 01:23:02.584
