-Are you tired?

1431
01:24:25.268 --> 01:24:27.803
-You do look like a squirrel.
-Do you want a cookie?

1432
01:24:31.673 --> 01:24:34.709
Inner peace.

1433
01:24:35.311 --> 01:24:37.646
Inner peace.

1434
01:24:38.713 --> 01:24:40.882
Inner peace.

1435
